{"id":"48778817c308e85e","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-natural-number-membership-per.md","title":"惰性自然数类型的成员 PER","display":"df-natural-number-membership-per — 惰性自然数类型的成员 PER","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-natural-number-membership-per","aliases":["72-df-natural-number-membership-per"],"display":"df-natural-number-membership-per — 惰性自然数类型的成员 PER","depends_on":["[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9 Neq and §3.10, print746,750/PDF758,762","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source inductive clauses, finite-stage closure and constructors checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-natural-number-membership-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-natural-number-membership-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-number-membership-per — 惰性自然数类型的成员 PER"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9 Neq and §3.10, print746,750/PDF758,762"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source inductive clauses, finite-stage closure and constructors checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a> 的确定、幂等求值条件。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf z\\in T\">\\(\\mathsf z\\in T\\)</span> 与单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{su}:T\\to T\">\\(\\mathsf{su}:T\\to T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{su})\">\\(\\mathsf z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{su})\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf z\\Downarrow\\mathsf z\">\\(\\mathsf z\\Downarrow\\mathsf z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{su}(a)\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)\">\\(\\mathsf{su}(a)\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)\\)</span> 对所有 a∈T 成立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_k\\subseteq T^2\">\\(N_k\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 与数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(k)\">\\(\\nu(k)\\)</span> 在下式按自然数递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neq}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neq}\\)</span> 为其并。构造子为惰性值，不要求参数 a 预先求值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nN_0&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\nN_{k+1}&amp;:=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T^2:(s\\Downarrow\\mathsf z\\land t\\Downarrow\\mathsf z)\\lor\n\\exists a,b\\in T\\ (s\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)\\land t\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(b)\\land\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in N_k)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Neq}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}N_k,\\qquad\n\\nu(0):=\\mathsf z,\\quad\\nu(k+1):=\\mathsf{su}(\\nu(k)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nN_0&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\nN_{k+1}&amp;:=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T^2:(s\\Downarrow\\mathsf z\\land t\\Downarrow\\mathsf z)\\lor\n\\exists a,b\\in T\\ (s\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)\\land t\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(b)\\land\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in N_k)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Neq}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}N_k,\\qquad\n\\nu(0):=\\mathsf z,\\quad\\nu(k+1):=\\mathsf{su}(\\nu(k)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐步展开正是书中“先观察零/后继值，再递归比较前驱”的最小关系。只给根求值不够：惰性后继的参数也必须在有限归纳中继续比较。确定性、后继单射性和零/后继不交是 PER 证明所需的结构条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的确定、幂等求值条件。给定 $\\mathsf z\\in T$ 与单射 $\\mathsf{su}:T\\to T$，$\\mathsf z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{su})$，且 $\\mathsf z\\Downarrow\\mathsf z$、$\\mathsf{su}(a)\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)$ 对所有 a∈T 成立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf z\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{su}:T\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{su})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf z\\Downarrow\\mathsf z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{su}(a)\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"N_k\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Neq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nN_0&:=\\varnothing,\\\\\nN_{k+1}&:=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T^2:(s\\Downarrow\\mathsf z\\land t\\Downarrow\\mathsf z)\\lor\n\\exists a,b\\in T\\ (s\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(a)\\land t\\Downarrow\\mathsf{su}(b)\\land\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in N_k)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Neq}&:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}N_k,\\qquad\n\\nu(0):=\\mathsf z,\\quad\\nu(k+1):=\\mathsf{su}(\\nu(k)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2008,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-560","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-555","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-183","location